[00:13.38]This is a song, a happy song of vict’ry;
[00:18.54]It magnifies the One who is supreme.
[00:23.82]The words give hope and prompt all to be loyal.
[00:29.52]Come sing with us; enjoy its Kingdom theme:
[00:34.19](Chorus)
[00:34.34]‘Come worship God Before his throne.
[00:40.26]His Son is King; Let’s make it known!
[00:46.14]Come learn this song, this song about the Kingdom;
[00:51.86]Bow down to God, and praise his holy name.’
[01:08.48]With this new song, we advertise the Kingdom.
[01:13.92]Christ Jesus rules; the earth is his domain.
[01:19.42]And as foretold, there is a newborn nation:
[01:24.94]The Kingdom heirs, who welcome Jesus’ reign:
[01:29.35](Chorus)
[01:29.50]‘Come worship God Before his throne.
[01:35.46]His Son is King; Let’s make it known!
[01:41.62]Come learn this song, this song about the Kingdom;
[01:46.42]Bow down to God, and praise his holy name.’
[02:11.90]This Kingdom song, all humble ones can master.
[02:17.10]The words are clear, their message warm and bright.
[02:22.90]In all the earth, a multitude have learned it,
[02:28.34]And they in turn still others now invite:
[02:32.79](Chorus)
[02:32.94]‘Come worship God Before his throne.
[02:38.78]His Son is King; Let’s make it known!
[02:44.75]Come learn this song, this song about the Kingdom;
[02:50.46]Bow down to God, and praise his holy name.’
